# Person Replacer - example timecode script
# Lines starting with # or // are ignored.
# The person name is matched against the FILENAMES in your videos folder,
# so "PERSON_B" picks up videos/PERSON_B_take3.mp4 (or any subfolder).

1
00:00:00:00 --> 00:00:05:00
PERSON_A

2
00:00:05:00 --> 00:00:12:12
PERSON_B: and then I told them the whole thing

3
00:00:12:12 --> 00:00:20:00
[PERSON_A]

# force one exact clip instead of letting the matcher choose:
4
00:00:20:00 --> 00:00:28:00
PERSON_B | PERSON_B_take4.mp4

# one-line form works too, and milliseconds are accepted:
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,500  sarah
